WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.756 --> 00:00:14.396
Why is it so hard

00:00:14.436 --> 00:00:17.996
to change the direction
of our civilization?

00:00:19.956 --> 00:00:23.676
I'd like to suggest
that what's missing at this point

00:00:23.676 --> 00:00:28.796
is not more facts and information
or even technology.

00:00:29.116 --> 00:00:31.396
We have more than enough.

00:00:32.756 --> 00:00:35.556
What's missing is insight.

00:00:36.476 --> 00:00:39.556
My teacher, Zen master Thich Nhat Hanh,

00:00:39.596 --> 00:00:44.756
has said that if we haven't yet
changed our way of living,

00:00:44.756 --> 00:00:49.116
it's because the awakening
isn't strong enough.

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:52.036
We can't hope to change the world

00:00:52.076 --> 00:00:55.796
if we can't change our own way
of seeing things,

00:00:55.836 --> 00:00:57.676
our consciousness.

00:00:58.396 --> 00:01:00.076
But how can we do this?

00:01:01.396 --> 00:01:02.716
In the Zen tradition,

00:01:02.756 --> 00:01:08.356
we know that awakening doesn't happen
only with the intellect.

00:01:08.956 --> 00:01:12.516
We need to engage our whole being

00:01:12.556 --> 00:01:15.636
right in the heart of the present moment.

00:01:16.636 --> 00:01:20.116
And a very simple way to do this

00:01:20.156 --> 00:01:24.636
is with the practice of mindful walking,

00:01:24.636 --> 00:01:26.476
a powerful meditation

00:01:26.516 --> 00:01:30.516
that doesn't require
hard labor or even extra time.

00:01:32.436 --> 00:01:36.916
Do you remember the first steps
you took outside this morning?

00:01:37.676 --> 00:01:41.156
The feel of the ground underfoot,

00:01:41.196 --> 00:01:43.596
the fall of the light,

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:46.716
the quality of the air.

00:01:48.076 --> 00:01:52.716
Do you remember
the first tree on your way?

00:01:54.636 --> 00:01:57.956
Life is there for us, but the question is,

00:01:57.996 --> 00:02:00.676
are we there for life?

00:02:02.156 --> 00:02:05.436
Perhaps this morning we had something
more important to do.

00:02:07.116 --> 00:02:09.396
Perhaps we were in a hurry.

00:02:10.476 --> 00:02:16.116
Many of us have a feeling
that we are running out of time.

00:02:17.596 --> 00:02:20.596
But when we rush to do something,

00:02:20.636 --> 00:02:23.316
are we saving time

00:02:23.316 --> 00:02:24.916
or are we losing it?

00:02:31.916 --> 00:02:35.636
There is a lot that is urgent,

00:02:35.676 --> 00:02:40.636
but in order to take
the kind of radical, decisive action

00:02:40.676 --> 00:02:43.196
that our planet is calling for,

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:45.716
we need to be fully present,

00:02:45.756 --> 00:02:48.076
grounded and alert,

00:02:48.116 --> 00:02:50.156
fearless and free.

00:02:51.036 --> 00:02:53.836
It is our way of being

00:02:53.836 --> 00:02:56.876
that has got us into our current crises,

00:02:56.916 --> 00:03:01.236
and it is our way of being
that can get us out.

00:03:02.516 --> 00:03:04.996
Mindful walking can help.

00:03:06.516 --> 00:03:12.916
We really feel the contact
between our feet and the ground.

00:03:16.276 --> 00:03:21.556
And we enjoy the harmony
between our breathing

00:03:21.596 --> 00:03:23.076
and our steps.

00:03:24.996 --> 00:03:30.956
With each step, we arrive into our body,

00:03:30.996 --> 00:03:32.996
into the present moment.

00:03:33.876 --> 00:03:39.316
And we become fascinated by the
whole experience of walking.

00:03:40.436 --> 00:03:43.356
And for those of us who are
physically unable to walk,

00:03:43.396 --> 00:03:46.356
perhaps we are in a wheelchair,

00:03:46.396 --> 00:03:51.676
we enjoy the experience
of moving through space.

00:03:53.036 --> 00:03:56.996
And we open up our senses to the sky,

00:03:57.036 --> 00:03:59.556
to the trees, to the people around us,

00:03:59.596 --> 00:04:03.556
or simply to the hum of life in the city.

00:04:04.556 --> 00:04:07.996
And we have a chance to wake up

00:04:08.036 --> 00:04:12.916
to what is going on, in us and around us.

00:04:13.876 --> 00:04:15.396
And in the Zen tradition,

00:04:15.436 --> 00:04:19.676
we also use questions to help us wake up.

00:04:20.196 --> 00:04:22.756
To help spark awakening.

00:04:22.796 --> 00:04:25.796
And today I would like to offer you three.

00:04:28.756 --> 00:04:30.756
The first question is:

00:04:33.956 --> 00:04:35.836
Who are you?

00:04:38.076 --> 00:04:39.396
Who are you?

00:04:42.476 --> 00:04:44.996
Say you're walking to do something.

00:04:45.036 --> 00:04:48.836
Perhaps something very important.

00:04:50.236 --> 00:04:54.076
Something that may be
the right thing to do

00:04:54.076 --> 00:04:55.716
but very hard.

00:04:57.716 --> 00:04:59.036
Ask yourself.

00:05:02.276 --> 00:05:06.116
Who is walking to do this?

00:05:10.516 --> 00:05:13.276
Can you see that you are, in fact,

00:05:13.276 --> 00:05:18.636
an entire lineage of parents,

00:05:18.676 --> 00:05:21.796
grandparents and ancestors?

00:05:22.316 --> 00:05:25.716
We carry all of them within us.

00:05:25.716 --> 00:05:29.396
Their qualities and their weaknesses.

00:05:30.076 --> 00:05:34.996
Their hopes, their regrets, their fears.

00:05:36.196 --> 00:05:41.236
Each one of us is in some way
an ambassador of our species.

00:05:42.036 --> 00:05:48.196
And as we walk, we have a chance
to activate the best of ourselves.

00:05:48.836 --> 00:05:51.876
The qualities of awakening.

00:05:52.516 --> 00:05:54.236
Endurance.

00:05:54.596 --> 00:05:56.116
Compassion.

00:05:56.716 --> 00:05:58.196
Generosity.

00:05:59.116 --> 00:06:01.796
Fearlessness and hope.

00:06:04.396 --> 00:06:08.596
And going further, as we walk, we realize

00:06:08.636 --> 00:06:14.756
that we embody millions
of years of evolution.

00:06:17.116 --> 00:06:22.876
Each one of us is nothing less
than a representative of the planet.

00:06:22.916 --> 00:06:25.036
A child of the Earth.

00:06:27.516 --> 00:06:30.516
In this very moment,

00:06:30.516 --> 00:06:36.836
we are all made of Earth, sun and stars.

00:06:37.756 --> 00:06:43.196
Mountains and rivers,
savannahs and rainforests.

00:06:43.996 --> 00:06:50.316
It is impossible for us to be
without all these elements.

00:06:51.476 --> 00:06:57.876
And realizing this is to see
with the insight of interbeing.

00:06:58.476 --> 00:07:01.996
This isn't just intellectual knowledge.

00:07:03.116 --> 00:07:08.596
But the living insight that you and I,

00:07:08.596 --> 00:07:12.076
we are much more than we think.

00:07:13.036 --> 00:07:17.476
And this is an immense source
of love and strength

00:07:17.516 --> 00:07:22.036
as we take action in the here and now.

00:07:23.116 --> 00:07:25.996
Which brings us to question number two.

00:07:27.916 --> 00:07:29.516
Where are you?

00:07:32.116 --> 00:07:33.396
Are you here?

00:07:34.556 --> 00:07:35.716
Are you now?

00:07:36.476 --> 00:07:41.996
Do you feel at home in yourself,
relaxed and at ease?

00:07:42.916 --> 00:07:47.836
Or is there still some restlessness,
perhaps a little agitation?

00:07:47.876 --> 00:07:52.116
We may feel distracted, preoccupied.

00:07:54.196 --> 00:07:57.756
There are those who say
we are too much in the present,

00:07:57.796 --> 00:08:00.436
not planning enough for the future.

00:08:01.396 --> 00:08:07.076
But there's a difference between being
alert and awake to what is going on

00:08:07.116 --> 00:08:10.356
and being lost in our work or projects,

00:08:10.396 --> 00:08:13.156
or drowning ourselves in consuming

00:08:13.156 --> 00:08:17.396
to cover up, escape from or numb ourselves

00:08:17.396 --> 00:08:20.116
to what is actually happening.

00:08:21.676 --> 00:08:24.756
Training our body and mind

00:08:24.796 --> 00:08:29.036
to be fully present in the here and now

00:08:29.036 --> 00:08:33.356
is essential to our survival

00:08:33.396 --> 00:08:36.556
and to the future we are creating.

00:08:38.556 --> 00:08:43.196
It is in the present
and only in the present

00:08:43.236 --> 00:08:46.876
that we can truly nourish our happiness

00:08:46.876 --> 00:08:52.436
and handle and take care of our pain
and our suffering.

00:08:54.276 --> 00:08:57.916
For example, in this moment,

00:08:57.956 --> 00:09:01.676
if each of us takes time
to really breathe in

00:09:01.716 --> 00:09:05.156
and come back to our body,

00:09:05.196 --> 00:09:07.316
we may find tension.

00:09:07.916 --> 00:09:12.436
And right now, on an out breath,

00:09:12.476 --> 00:09:16.076
we have a chance to release that tension.

00:09:16.076 --> 00:09:18.196
This is possible right away.

00:09:19.716 --> 00:09:23.396
If we come back to ourselves
in this moment

00:09:23.396 --> 00:09:27.036
and we find sadness,

00:09:27.076 --> 00:09:30.516
we have a chance to embrace it.

00:09:31.916 --> 00:09:34.996
If we find fear,

00:09:34.996 --> 00:09:38.636
anger, despair,

00:09:38.676 --> 00:09:42.356
we have a chance to accompany it,

00:09:42.396 --> 00:09:44.436
to be with it

00:09:44.436 --> 00:09:49.316
and to look deeply
into what it is telling us.

00:09:50.516 --> 00:09:55.596
Our suffering contains within it
the suffering of our world.

00:09:56.476 --> 00:09:59.356
The violence, the destruction,

00:09:59.396 --> 00:10:02.596
the discrimination and exploitation

00:10:02.636 --> 00:10:06.596
that is going on right now
across our planet.

00:10:08.156 --> 00:10:11.836
We are doing real harm

00:10:11.876 --> 00:10:16.036
to one another and to all species.

00:10:18.116 --> 00:10:22.116
And the more we realize this,
the more we awaken to this,

00:10:22.156 --> 00:10:24.756
we want to do something to help,

00:10:24.796 --> 00:10:27.036
to transform the situation.

00:10:27.436 --> 00:10:31.996
But this requires a tremendous
source of energy.

00:10:31.996 --> 00:10:35.716
And where can we ever find enough energy?

00:10:37.036 --> 00:10:38.276
In the Buddhist tradition,

00:10:38.316 --> 00:10:44.556
we know that our intention,
our deepest aspiration,

00:10:44.596 --> 00:10:48.156
is an immense source of energy.

00:10:49.156 --> 00:10:53.236
Which brings us to question number three.

00:10:55.396 --> 00:10:56.756
What do you want?

00:10:59.156 --> 00:11:02.596
What do you really want?

00:11:04.756 --> 00:11:07.836
What is most important to you?

00:11:09.436 --> 00:11:15.516
This is not only about doing,
this is also about being.

00:11:17.076 --> 00:11:23.236
It is possible to be firmly rooted
in the present moment,

00:11:24.156 --> 00:11:28.036
and yet motivated,
energized by a deep desire,

00:11:28.076 --> 00:11:32.596
a deep love to contribute
something positive.

00:11:33.356 --> 00:11:36.476
And wherever we choose
to make our contribution,

00:11:36.476 --> 00:11:41.156
our task is to do our best in that spot

00:11:41.156 --> 00:11:42.916
and we will have peace.

00:11:43.956 --> 00:11:49.516
Even the simplest act born from love

00:11:49.516 --> 00:11:52.596
resonates without limit.

00:11:55.796 --> 00:11:57.476
So we're walking.

00:11:59.116 --> 00:12:01.956
And we can arrive into our life

00:12:01.996 --> 00:12:03.276
at every step.

00:12:07.476 --> 00:12:09.516
And we get to ask ourself,

00:12:12.276 --> 00:12:15.916
Is this how I want to live my life?

00:12:21.676 --> 00:12:23.796
Life is short,

00:12:23.796 --> 00:12:27.116
and each one of us needs to identify

00:12:27.156 --> 00:12:30.636
and nurture our deepest aspiration,

00:12:30.636 --> 00:12:32.996
rekindle it if necessary

00:12:33.036 --> 00:12:39.476
and find a community of friends and allies
who share the same dream.

00:12:40.236 --> 00:12:42.556
And with the insight of interbeing,

00:12:42.596 --> 00:12:47.676
we see that we're not a small me
realizing our dream,

00:12:47.716 --> 00:12:50.636
but a vast us.

00:12:51.636 --> 00:12:56.396
And we arrive at our destination

00:12:56.396 --> 00:12:58.436
in every step.

00:13:02.836 --> 00:13:05.396
So who am I?

00:13:07.236 --> 00:13:09.196
Where am I?

00:13:09.916 --> 00:13:11.636
And what do I want?

00:13:12.436 --> 00:13:17.756
The act of asking these three questions
in the heart of our daily life,

00:13:17.796 --> 00:13:19.436
as we walk,

00:13:19.436 --> 00:13:21.556
will help us to wake up.

00:13:22.796 --> 00:13:24.236
Because the fact is,

00:13:24.276 --> 00:13:28.876
if we keep going
in the direction we are going,

00:13:28.916 --> 00:13:33.756
there is no doubt
our civilization will end soon.

00:13:35.236 --> 00:13:40.276
Many civilizations have ended,
and ours is no different.

00:13:40.316 --> 00:13:45.436
And if our awakening to this truth
is not strong enough,

00:13:45.476 --> 00:13:48.756
our actions will not be strong enough

00:13:48.796 --> 00:13:52.796
to heal ourselves
and to protect our Earth.

00:13:54.116 --> 00:13:59.596
We need to see the suffering, the truth,
in order to get the awakening.

00:14:00.116 --> 00:14:03.116
There's a deep connection
between the two.

00:14:05.796 --> 00:14:09.956
We can't help if we're numb
or if we're overwhelmed.

00:14:10.836 --> 00:14:15.396
Only when we dare to feel in our body

00:14:15.436 --> 00:14:17.196
what all these facts,

00:14:17.236 --> 00:14:19.996
all this information means,

00:14:19.996 --> 00:14:23.756
will we truly awaken

00:14:23.756 --> 00:14:26.676
to the preciousness of life.

00:14:27.756 --> 00:14:31.236
And to the danger we are in.

00:14:32.556 --> 00:14:36.476
And we have the spiritual strength;
we need to do this.

00:14:38.316 --> 00:14:42.236
Mindful breathing and walking

00:14:42.276 --> 00:14:46.396
can give us stability and non-fear.

00:14:48.476 --> 00:14:50.636
Being in contact with nature

00:14:50.676 --> 00:14:54.476
lifts our spirits and heals our soul.

00:14:55.876 --> 00:15:01.196
The Earth, our ancestors
and our descendants,

00:15:01.236 --> 00:15:05.476
they are all here with us in this moment.

00:15:06.316 --> 00:15:10.516
Giving us clarity to see the truth

00:15:10.516 --> 00:15:16.236
and courage to take radical loving action.

00:15:17.956 --> 00:15:22.076
And with this awakening
and this spiritual strength,

00:15:22.116 --> 00:15:26.196
it is possible for us to act

00:15:26.196 --> 00:15:29.436
with the urgency of today

00:15:29.436 --> 00:15:34.156
and also with the freedom of eternity.

00:16:00.716 --> 00:16:01.916
Thank you.

00:16:01.956 --> 00:16:08.436
(Applause)

